    "description": "Changes\n\ud83d\ude80 Features\n<ul>\n<li>added --version to CLI (via snakebids.yml) @akhanf (#210)</li>\n<li>allows output of subfields using multiple unfolded atlases @jordandekraker (#200)</li>\n</ul>\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n<ul>\n<li>bugfix: subfields label.gii wasn't being generated properly @akhanf (#211)</li>\n<li>bugfix: subfield+tissue for new atlases, and tsv files @akhanf (#208)</li>\n<li>hippdwi bounding box for L and R flipped @akhanf (#204)</li>\n</ul>\n\ud83e\uddf0 Maintenance\n<ul>\n<li>updated deploy workflow with bumpversion changes @akhanf (#213)</li>\n<li>Extras moved to toolbox @jordandekraker (#207)</li>\n<li>Unfolddentatetemplate patch @jordandekraker (#203)</li>\n</ul>\n\ud83d\udcdd Documentation\n<ul>\n<li>Test data @akhanf (#209)</li>\n<li>Multiple atlases updating docs \\&amp; coding style @akhanf (#205)</li>\n</ul>",
